    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. If <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
